    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/7a2ff9bc9ff46c22ef25c0971f31fb32.poster.avif?t=1755721441\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/7a2ff9bc9ff46c22ef25c0971f31fb32.webm?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/7a2ff9bc9ff46c22ef25c0971f31fb32.mp4?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luscious 'shrooms await the clever slug.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/8d17bd026c5b9725c976c0ee1601a308.poster.avif?t=1755721441\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/8d17bd026c5b9725c976c0ee1601a308.webm?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/8d17bd026c5b9725c976c0ee1601a308.mp4?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Set out with your pals to munch them all.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/4f990f323ef6083825710c5218935267.poster.avif?t=1755721441\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/4f990f323ef6083825710c5218935267.webm?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/4f990f323ef6083825710c5218935267.mp4?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Don't be careless with your moves, or you'll dry up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/c00d803a2d3ecbef2a3855d57e8f09cc.avif?t=1755721441\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get yourself to some tasty <strong>'shrooms</strong> using <strong>limited movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put that slug brain to work solving increasingly difficult 2D\u00a0<strong>spatial puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your mind by mastering the abilities of <strong>3 unique slugs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve over <strong>50 puzzles</strong> across <strong>3 funky zones</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>slime</strong> wisely!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/7a2ff9bc9ff46c22ef25c0971f31fb32.poster.avif?t=1755721441\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/7a2ff9bc9ff46c22ef25c0971f31fb32.webm?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/7a2ff9bc9ff46c22ef25c0971f31fb32.mp4?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luscious 'shrooms await the clever slug.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/8d17bd026c5b9725c976c0ee1601a308.poster.avif?t=1755721441\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/8d17bd026c5b9725c976c0ee1601a308.webm?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/8d17bd026c5b9725c976c0ee1601a308.mp4?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Set out with your pals to munch them all.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/4f990f323ef6083825710c5218935267.poster.avif?t=1755721441\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/4f990f323ef6083825710c5218935267.webm?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/4f990f323ef6083825710c5218935267.mp4?t=1755721441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Don't be careless with your moves, or you'll dry up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/c00d803a2d3ecbef2a3855d57e8f09cc.avif?t=1755721441\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get yourself to some tasty <strong>'shrooms</strong> using <strong>limited movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put that slug brain to work solving increasingly difficult 2D\u00a0<strong>spatial puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your mind by mastering the abilities of <strong>3 unique slugs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve over <strong>50 puzzles</strong> across <strong>3 funky zones</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>slime</strong> wisely!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Sometimes you just gotta take a break from that busy city life and get back to nature, you know? Just you, your best buds, and a giant slug bus foraging for mushrooms. Some of these \u2018shrooms look real tricky to get though\u2026",
